# The Cast receiver image builds with the repository root as context (CI and
# compose) so it can install from the root package-lock.json. BuildKit uses
# this file instead of a root .dockerignore. It is an allowlist: only the root
# manifest and lockfile, app/cast-receiver and the shared Cast protocol and
# fonts are sent. data/, media/, test-music/, .git/, .env and the other apps
# never leave the host.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!app/cast-receiver/
!app/shared/cast/
!app/shared/fonts/

# Installed and generated output, even inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
